    "Adds what already went out, scheduled bills and what you usually spend until the end of the month." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rechnet zusammen, was schon ausgegeben wurde, geplante Rechnungen und was du bis Monatsende üblicherweise ausgibst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suma lo que ya salió, las facturas programadas y lo que sueles gastar hasta fin de mes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Additionne ce qui est déjà sorti, les factures programmées et ce que vous dépensez d’habitude jusqu’à la fin du mois."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Somma quanto è già uscito, le bollette programmate e quanto spendi di solito fino a fine mese."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すでに出た分、予定された支払い、月末までの通常の支出を合計します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이미 나간 금액, 예정된 청구서, 월말까지 평소 지출하는 금액을 합산합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Soma o que já saiu, as contas agendadas e o que você costuma gastar até o fim do mês."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Складывает уже потраченное, запланированные счета и обычные расходы до конца месяца."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "汇总已支出的金额、已安排的账单以及你到月底通常的花费。"
          }
        }
      }
